[{"client_msg_id":"407f8a49-12e4-4ce0-a26e-2f9a0b5b37d2","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"でも、起動するだけで、6℃上がるアプリはそうそう無いですよね…","ts":"1632142337.043000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"laughing","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BbH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a098fcf9-1693-424f-8f95-357818a8b76f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"私はそうだと解釈しています。","ts":"1632142223.042400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OJd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54887008-cf8a-4fb1-b7c8-755111b6aee8","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そこらへんはCPUのスケジューリング(をやってるはずの)ドライバはいった影響なんですかねえ","ts":"1632142202.042100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/fUg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5747c71c-55a5-4598-886d-bc6b33418d96","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"↑ 確定情報じゃなくて、そう解釈できる現象に遭遇したことがある、という話しです。","ts":"1632142182.041700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PVFS9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c615a91e-5432-4e27-b2bc-7446d802c894","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"数個のスレッドをぶん回してパフォーマンスモニタで見てると、アクティブなのがどんどん移り変わっていくのが見れますよ。面白いのはAMD(Ryzen)だと4個単位でズレてて、ZenのCCXの構造を反映してるっぽく見えるんですよね。","ts":"1632141986.040900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xoC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d510f3ab-ab64-4dc4-af4d-4d2a4d7ae86a","type":"message","user":"ULXMF1BC1","text":"一番高い温度のコアの温度を見るツール、であれば、コアが移動してるかどうかはわからないような。","ts":"1632141613.039100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+oVVC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1344acab-3f5f-4199-a3b8-19d974575ac8","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"で、アフィニティっていうのを指定すると実行するコアを指定・限定できるので、アプリで無理やり止めてるんちゃうかな。","ts":"1632141446.038400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wgpX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ae96862-c99d-4ecd-a1fc-43443643a09d","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"たぶん熱を分散させるためだとは思います。","ts":"1632141409.037700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FoO=N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6e466ce-1842-4539-9e9e-6da28ee6cbaf","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ちゃんと検証したわけではないのでちょっと確実度下がる情報ですけどね。","ts":"1632141380.037100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zIlai"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a655cdfe-652f-4417-a2d9-83ca321c28a6","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"Windowsは基本的にシングルスレッドでぶん回しても、勝手にコア変えてきますよ。IntelもAMDも。","ts":"1632141329.036500","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1632141354.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"96tvT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"889c1779-527e-499c-9f5e-6eff4f42affb","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ああ、逆か、アフィニティで固定してんのか。","ts":"1632141301.035900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gADyH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"993aa6ae-9c7d-46ea-bc53-7fa9196dc516","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あれ? アフィニティでずらされないっけ?","ts":"1632141277.035400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qim"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b14ce207-0ff6-4598-be91-27ef03c2338c","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"コピペしてきたときに、「マ」が抜けました… マヌケですね…orz","ts":"1632137152.034400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"iinoyo","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]},{"name":"zabuton3","count":2,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9t+tx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b4d9aa8-8e80-4125-994e-a29785dd6e0d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ルチ将軍ならしょうがない(CPU100%スレッド、適度にコア移動させるような仕組みあってもいい気がしてきたが、難しいかもなあ)","ts":"1632137022.033800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"djB4O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8186d0b9-735f-4efc-9810-ffcf917eb527","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01LMLBA867/p1630659509007400\u003e\nこの原因、わかりました。\nとあるアプリがマルチスレッド非対応らしく、1コアをほぼ100%稼働させてて、一番高い温度のコアの温度を見るツールだと、そこの値を見るからということでした。\n常駐アプリも全部落とすと47℃くらい、普段のアプリ起動したら52℃ と、許容範囲になりました。","ts":"1632136910.033000","attachments":[{"fallback":"[September 3rd, 2021 1:58 AM] raa0121: 5900X でCPU温度が平均65℃なんですが、冷却が足りてないんですかね…\n排熱のおかげで室温が30℃になってて、なかなか辛いんですが…","id":1,"author_id":"U06ECBRTJ","author_name":"raa0121","author_subname":"raa0121","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U06ECBRTJ","author_icon":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/35b032d7b2d4182b0c2de1ef85ba91f2.jpg?s=48\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0012-48.png","text":"5900X でCPU温度が平均65℃なんですが、冷却が足りてないんですかね…\n排熱のおかげで室温が30℃になってて、なかなか辛いんですが…","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #hobby-hardware","ts":1630659509.007400,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01LMLBA867/p1630659509007400","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01LMLBA867/p1630659509007400"}],"edited":{"user":"U06ECBRTJ","ts":"1632137129.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS","U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gOdy"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01F9KGKAGP","text":"\u003c@U01F9KGKAGP\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1632104394.032000","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null}]
